Instrumentation for xgboost v3.1.2 (dcb2f4e32) — gpu-numeric-fidelity 2.2.1.

Prints every tile winner reaching DeviceSplitCandidate::Update (with the
accept/reject outcome via before/after loss_chg) and every post-reduce
per-node winner. Applied by the cajeta repo's gpu-probe workflow
(probe=instrumented-eval) before building xgboost from source on PHOENIX;
the built xgboost.dll replaces the wheel's, and train_repro.py reruns the
tiny_reg_mcw10 fixture. Decides why the real binary records feature 4 at
node 14 while the verbatim kernel transcription (and the port) score
feature 1 higher from provably identical input.

diff --git a/src/tree/gpu_hist/evaluate_splits.cu b/src/tree/gpu_hist/evaluate_splits.cu
